ld appreciate it if the head and left and right sides of the image are not obscured.\n\u3000If possible, we would appreciate it if you could make the background transparent.\n\n\u3000Thank you in advance.\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/g55vb2tz45n2y0fqviiw1/h?rlkey=3dv2haz46pluufzzpe34znyit&dl=0", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@yonph2/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1154032, "client_id": 1363888, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff45691d1542872aeda8371a362dbf66", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff45691d1542872aeda8371a362dbf66, https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=457cadeea1359ebe0c7480d06c383f6f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb94da278eb30236f1cedfa2386d693c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cc4127f536aa7437c27bb0b4b485113e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cc4127f536aa7437c27bb0b4b485113e, https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=96fb2adadfe3c80019bf9c188a8688cd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=34968dd9d6dc656858b78ce9a0cfca21 3x"}, "body": "Hi Yonha! I'm glad to hear that skeb is now open! Please excuse my request...!\n\nIf you don't mind, I'd like to have Koji-kun and Yamato...! I would like to leave everything to you, including the composition of the illustration! I would be most happy if you could draw them as you like...!\nLastly, I wish you a long and healthy life...! I hope you have a long and healthy life!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@yonph2/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1154032, "client_id": 953483, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a409571db314bab112f8e3dc8f0d76ba", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a409571db314bab112f8e3dc8f0d76ba, https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95e76b10569d299cca7155db45e6fc9e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=234e34970c9f02ff878e0dc7bfd52aae 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=27464b21ce9a2fc712fd2dfd083dce43", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=27464b21ce9a2fc712fd2dfd083dce43, https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=556ebd682e21fa4cf8f8ce12cc6d91ff 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a47ccad83f81ff18f901d714e6f96b3f 3x"}, "body": "Hello, my name is HALF.\nI always support Yonha's life.\n\nWhat I would like to request this time is an illustration of a TRPG self-seeker.\n\nhttps://iachara.com/view/2611507\nThe character is called Tadara Fujinmu, and he is going through VOID at HO3.\nHe is a loose uncle with a helter-skelter atmosphere at first glance, but he always lives with anxiety in his heart.\nHe fears more than anything else that his friends are in danger.\n\nWe asked Yonha to create this character because we thought that his aesthetic and decadent atmosphere would be a good match with the inner life of Fujinushi.\n\nReally, if it is possible, I would be happy if Mr. Yonha's searcher, Goedo Ameirin, could be there as well.\n\nThe content of the picture is completely up to you.\n\nI know I've messed up, but I love all of your illustrations, so there is no problem at all if you ignore everything I've said so far and draw whatever you want.\n\nI would appreciate it if you could respond to my request when you are free.\n\nI love Yonha's drawings. \uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\uff01\n\nhttps://iachara.com/view/2611507", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"